{"title":"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the addition problem, each digit has been replaced by a letter.  If different letters represent different digits then what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/8/8e88799a4ccdbb6c37dec56b6b67f175e419db0b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(18); draw((-1,0)--(3,0)); draw((-3/4,1/2)--(-1/4,1/2)); draw((-1/2,1/4)--(-1/2,3/4)); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,(0.5,2.1),N); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,(1.5,2.1),N); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,(2.5,2.1),N); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,(1.5,1.1),N); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,(2.5,1.1),N); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,(2.5,0.1),N); label(&quot;$3$&quot;,(0.5,-.1),S); label(&quot;$0$&quot;,(1.5,-.1),S); label(&quot;$0$&quot;,(2.5,-.1),S); [/asy]\" width=\"122\" height=\"112\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/3/0b324531c4e9aa97effe0399a23e0369c7a04803.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 5 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 7 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"330\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/3/9e353de40230ddfde9d5e226ff75f3e439eeac23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A \\geq 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"17\" /> this sum would be larger than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/9/b899aba26cc33f0026125daebb44a60349c999b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$300$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />, which is too large.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/8/f98df3bb92b1de33f7d3b4b3ab5e5a37e1add54e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A \\leq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"17\" /> this sum would be at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/5/fe56b16666cd0d8202f625be4496f752d15301c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$199 + 19 + 1 = 219$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"152\" height=\"15\" />, which is too small.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/c/e1c13d77e2b5ede10a622c2229043191de82ce17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = 2$\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d95ea08412bcf32a226012490d54869e9f95ba8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B \\geq 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"50\" height=\"17\" /> this sum would be at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/a/b1a7610963c77c0b117c78d1ed998e4b14d5cd72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$280 + 28 + 2 = 310$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"152\" height=\"15\" />, which is too large.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/b/69bce00d43cfd57892bf2375709408fb0e597310.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B \\leq 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"50\" height=\"17\" /> this sum would be at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/e/13e8808cf30146985b63ea75967af6af0cffa569.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$269 + 26 + 2 = 297$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"152\" height=\"15\" />, which is too small.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/2/d92e3d0a342cedbff3cbc989596f5907ac3f15f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>This forces <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/6/30699a405cf74561d55abbbca8158cf476307d55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"96\" height=\"30\" />, for a sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/b/bcb38fef08e452786bbf35a983af6ae3ced84efc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$271 + 27 + 2 = 300$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"152\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From this we have \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/9/2a9bc8582cda2534a8032588cda0209002437bad.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[111A+11B+C=300.\\]\" width=\"185\" height=\"14\" />\nClearly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/0/4802fda401b1f02112c144de57e7da66e815af19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A&lt;3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/c/20c5fc296c2c0a02bcbfdb2a21fbaca32cc92052.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B,C\\leq 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"70\" height=\"16\" />, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/b/7cb3207cd37022d15ebdb849d7e8df2fea60c300.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[111A &gt; 201 \\Rightarrow A\\geq 2.\\]\" width=\"169\" height=\"15\" />\nThus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/1/4f1a0a1fba5abcc1686547b4c9754aa25665358a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=2$\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/b/99b2aaa0690720cbf1b0f1997c0e3b1d20f95dab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11B+C=78$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"111\" height=\"14\" />.  From here it becomes clear that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/a/60a765dd50ab9897a3b7fb753acb428551d1fcc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=7$\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/a/1aaff92590788495e83f62997834c4193ab6c1c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C=1\\rightarrow \\boxed{\\text{A}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"100\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using logic, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/6/e26521a2a45d24692bfd74a950fe496c77662f60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c= 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"111\" height=\"14\" />, therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/7/9974277f3d9922fa559171e3d699af7bec034c07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+a+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"70\" height=\"14\" />(from the carry over)<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/a/caa9a9d4fd1c361a737f0d4a134f2d33428708d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />.\nSo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/a/afa7efc8ccc9fe8a049caa8dc2e2d8f95c1f9cbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+a=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/5/bd5a8727d60bea5f28a660ece5dce68d54acca7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+1=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"77\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/1/4f1a0a1fba5abcc1686547b4c9754aa25665358a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=2$\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/b/99b2aaa0690720cbf1b0f1997c0e3b1d20f95dab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11B+C=78$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"111\" height=\"14\" />.  From here it becomes clear that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/a/60a765dd50ab9897a3b7fb753acb428551d1fcc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=7$\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/a/1aaff92590788495e83f62997834c4193ab6c1c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C=1\\rightarrow \\boxed{\\text{A}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"100\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME\" title=\"1991 AJHSME\">1991 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1991\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017182717\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 229/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2302/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 132/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6076/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.962      1 -total\n 58.65%    8.189      1 Template:AJHSME_box\n 38.91%    5.433      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:834